    section1Title: "What this covers",
    section1Body: "The team confirms your venue, ready-by time and total quantity in one enquiry, then plans a realistic tying sequence — groom first, then close family, then the wider baraat — so the ceremony schedule is protected.",
    section2Title: "How to book",
    section2Body: "Booking works best when the groom, family and baraati quantities are shared separately, since each group is styled differently. Send all three together for the most accurate quote.",
    section3Title: "Who usually books this",
